<title>USA: MidAmerican 515 MW Iowa unit back on line.</title>
<headline>MidAmerican 515 MW Iowa unit back on line.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MidAmerican Energy Co's 515 megawatt (MW) coal-fired unit 3 at its Neal Generating Station in Iowa resumed operation yesterday as expected, the company said Thursday.</p>
<p>The unit was shut last weekend to repair a boiler tube leak.</p>
<p>MidAmerican operates and owns 72 percent interest in the Neal unit.</p>
<p>Neal unit 3 is located 15 miles south of Sioux City, Iowa, along the Missouri River.</p>
<p>--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1622</p>
</text>
